    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Spiral</i> is a first-person roguelike dungeon crawler. Explore the dungeon, find tools for your survival, and try to escape with your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an infinite dungeon with randomized layouts, items, and enemies. No two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the dungeon's bounty to survive. Simple farming tools, legendary weapons, curious potions, and enchanted charms are all at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Your Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Monsters, nightmares, and other desperate wanderers like you all call the dungeon home. Kill them before they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Spiral</i> is a first-person roguelike dungeon crawler. Explore the dungeon, find tools for your survival, and try to escape with your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an infinite dungeon with randomized layouts, items, and enemies. No two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/88804a19e87c24672427d427b39ec360.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the dungeon's bounty to survive. Simple farming tools, legendary weapons, curious potions, and enchanted charms are all at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/6a1df654b5ff686de94cc2b2702ed716.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Your Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Monsters, nightmares, and other desperate wanderers like you all call the dungeon home. Kill them before they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.poster.avif?t=1739380200\" width=618 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.webm?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577020/extras/23881fd8dc45c9bec9ec482d70ebc118.mp4?t=1739380200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
